---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="About Us">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white sm:text-4xl">About ForestAI</h1>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Our Mission</h2>
      <p>ForestAI is dedicated to transforming forest management through AI-powered analysis of drone imagery. Our mission is to provide accurate, actionable insights that help preserve and sustain forest ecosystems worldwide.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Our Technology</h2>
      <p>Using advanced computer vision and machine learning algorithms, we analyze drone-captured imagery to detect tree health, species classification, growth patterns, and potential threats like disease or pests.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">The Team</h2>
      <p>Founded in 2023 by forestry experts and AI researchers, our team combines deep domain knowledge with cutting-edge technology to deliver innovative solutions for forest conservation and management.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Contact Us</h2>
      <p>For inquiries or partnerships, please email us at <a href="mailto:contact@forestai.com" class="text-green-600 hover:text-green-800 dark:text-green-400 dark:hover:text-green-300">contact@forestai.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>